  "dek": "Two climbers now wait just outside the 37.98 gold line, and a late 32.70 puts jf liao among the provisional silver places, while Tufa Labs and Yi-Chia Chen hold the top two.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-3 Late edition: insuperabilehart closes on ARC-3 gold as jf liao vaults into silver. insuperabilehart climbed from 28th to 21st at 37.39, 0.59 below the 37.98 provisional gold line, with Tong Hui Kang 0.06 short at 20th. jf liao jumped from 2,381st to 177th at 32.70, above the provisional silver cutoff of 32.25. Tufa Labs (68.91) and Yi-Chia Chen (67.49) hold the top two; the top ten are unchanged. https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-21-evening-arc-3",
