  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Two names at the gold door",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-1402-arc-3-tong-hui-kang-nears-gold-places"
      ],
      "text": "insuperabilehart rose from 28th to 21st on the day's score event, lifting its mark from 36.73 to 37.39. That leaves the team 0.59 below SparseTech, who hold the nineteenth and last provisional gold place at 37.98. Tong Hui Kang, whom the wire placed 20th at 37.92, still sits 0.06 short, and the gold line itself did not move all day. Two entries now press the same boundary, so a single further advance by either would change who holds a medal place. These public medal bands remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "A late leap into silver",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "jf liao produced the evening's largest observed jump. A score event shortly before the close lifted the entry from 1.07 to 32.70 and from 2,381st to 177th, which is above the provisional silver cutoff of 32.25. It is one result in a line of overnight and daytime climbers, but the size of the move stands out on a board of more than 4,500 teams. Robin also rose to 162nd at 32.81 from 31.99, a gain of 90 places over the edition baseline."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The summit holds",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs leads at 68.91, with Yi-Chia Chen second at 67.49, a 1.42-point gap. Team Turducken is third at 52.82, ahead of mtg at 50.37 and the last dance at 49.85. The top ten kept both order and scores against the edition baseline, with NVARC3 tenth at 43.94. The action sits well below them, where the gold line has stayed still while the silver line crept from 32.21 to 32.25."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movers in the top hundred",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-0805-arc-3-abstraction-lab-mindsai-enters-top-hundred"
      ],
      "text": "Hugo Thorvaldsen added 0.67 to reach 36.16 and climbed 11 places to 33rd. Abstraction Lab & MindsAI, which the wire reported moving from 464th to 78th on a gain of 2.98, holds 78th at 33.78 on the closing board. paul's event took the entry from 33.83 to 34.69 and from 76th to 54th. The social scan was not refreshed for this edition, so the account rests on the public board and the wire."
    }
  ],
